{"id":"adf58ca2c7888ac9","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-bisimulation-example.md","title":"Bisimulation Example","display":"ex-bisimulation-example — Bisimulation Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-bisimulation-example","aliases":["89-ex-bisimulation-example"],"display":"ex-bisimulation-example — Bisimulation Example","depends_on":["[[89-df-bisimulation]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-bisimulation-example"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-bisimulation-example</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-bisimulation-example — Bisimulation Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_1=(\\{u\\},\\varnothing,V_1)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_1=(\\{u\\},\\varnothing,V_1)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_2=(\\{v\\},\\varnothing,V_2)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_2=(\\{v\\},\\varnothing,V_2)\\)</span> are one-world Kripke models.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;(u\\in V_1(p)\\leftrightarrow v\\in V_2(p))\">\\(\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;(u\\in V_1(p)\\leftrightarrow v\\in V_2(p))\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\}\">\\(Z\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M_1,\\mathcal M_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M_1,\\mathcal M_2)\\)</span> is the predicate from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}example}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal{M}_1,\\mathcal{M}_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}example}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal{M}_1,\\mathcal{M}_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> : 互模拟 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f233d5485efaad7c\" href=\"?note=f233d5485efaad7c\" title=\"89-df-bisimulation\">89-df-bisimulation</a>)</li>\n<li>原子协调条件由第二条假设给出；两模型都没有后继，因此 forth 与\nback 条件真空成立。</li>\n<li>互模拟点满足相同模态公式是后续不变性引理的结论，不是这个例子对\n<code>Bisim</code> 定义的循环预设。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M_1,\\mathcal M_2)$ is the predicate from\n[[89-df-bisimulation]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bisimulation","status":"resolved","id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$Z$ : 互模拟 (see [[89-df-bisimulation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}_1=(\\{u\\},\\varnothing,V_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}_2=(\\{v\\},\\varnothing,V_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;(u\\in V_1(p)\\leftrightarrow v\\in V_2(p))","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M_1,\\mathcal M_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}bisimulation\\text{-}example}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal{M}_1,\\mathcal{M}_2).","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false}],"bytes":1106,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-569","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-ex-bisimulation-example]]"}],"outgoing":["f233d5485efaad7c","ab746eb779e20ce0"]}